 786:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         HAL_ADCEx_InjectedStop_IT() API must be called for ADC master first,
 787:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         then for ADC slave.
 788:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         For ADC master, conversion is stopped and ADC is disabled.
 789:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         For ADC slave, ADC is disabled only (conversion stop of ADC master
 790:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         has already stopped conversion of ADC slave).
